        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ac8455/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-27T10:44:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Variant unlock guesses, probably incomplete:</p><p>AZ: Freedom 6 Zero's ice powers are in overdrive after a bad experience, so: \"Absolute Zero incaps himself with fire damage.\"&nbsp;</p><p><span>Tachyon: Freedom 6 Tachy is pictured with the HUD goggles and lets everyone else draw cards, so \"With HUD goggles in play, play all 3 copies of Fleet of Foot in a single turn.\"</span></p><p><span>Wraith: F6 Wraith appears to be using the Operative's weaponry and does Melee damage: \"Wraith Incapacitates the Operative with damage from Combat Stance.\"</span></p><p>I assume Bunker, Unity, and Tempest will have to be incapped somehow to unlock their variants, but I don't have good guesses how.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:33:39.145Z",
