        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"mwc146\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n mwc146:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Dreamer is a 3, La Capitan and Kismet are both 2s.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Dreamer's mostly tough because you don't want to use your \"all villain targets\" tricks.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Kismet can be as frustrating as Miss Information, if she manages to pull a lot of Jinx cards and gimp your heroes.&nbsp;</p>",
