        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Praion\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/e9bcb4/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Praion:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Unity incap with all Freedom 5 bots out?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Possibly. Or maybe with Con's Bunker in play. Or both.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>She's wearing Fixer's hat, too. Maybe he'll have to be in play or incapped.&nbsp;</p>",
