      {
        "id": 154192,
        "name": "Silverleaf",
        "username": "Silverleaf",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-27T12:07:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"mightyschoop\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ac8455/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> mightyschoop:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Praion wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Unity incap with all Freedom 5 bots out?\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nPossibly. Or maybe with Con's Bunker in play. Or both.&nbsp;She's wearing Fixer's hat, too. Maybe he'll have to be in play or incapped.&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Golem Unity is wearing Fixer's hat because Fixer is dead - Christopher told me that before the Dark Watch Promos were released. He also said that whenever you see Fixer without having his hat, he's dead. So of course I got very excited when I saw the DW Fixer artwork… and interestingly enough, when I actually paid attention to the art on Meditation.</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:33:39.410Z",
