        "created_at": "2016-01-28T16:44:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is gonna have the unlockable Tempest where you nuke one of your ongoings to draw 3 cards right? &nbsp;Aw man, I was hoping for the variant where you can play 3 cards at a cost of 3 life, and yes I can see the gift horse and he has very nice teeth. :)</p><p>That said, are us vidgame users going to eventually get the Prime Warden variants to play with? &nbsp;4 of them look like very fun variations on their base characters (can't speak for Capt Cosmic since I've never played with him period)</p>",
