        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/a698b9/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-01T23:05:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I haven't been able to load it onto my nook HD, unfortunately. I've tried: clearing the cache for Google Play Store, clearing the data from Google Play Store, force closing Google Play Store, verifying that I have enough storage on the device, uninstalling and reinstalling the game, completely powering the device down, and checking for Google Play Store updates (of which there were apparently none). Any other suggestions? I'm anxious to see Jim and O-X in action!</p>",
