        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mariofanaticxv/{size}/2129_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-02T06:53:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm putting my money on the Prime Wardens coming with Wrath of the Cosmos, seeing as that's how it was for the physical game. Doubt we'll see Rogue Agent K.N.Y.F.E. though...<br><br>You know, I just realized: Since they're doing Vengeance after Mini-Pack 3, that means we'll be seeing Ominitron IV before Omnitron III (Omniblade).</p>",
